{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "List arguments refused by the Node and WASM facades. A list of audio planes is refused as '<arg> must be an array of Float32Array' and a wrong plane as '<arg>[i] must be a Float32Array'; any other list is refused as '<arg> must be an array'. An object carrying a length is not a list.",
